## Open evidence limits

- Futex wake/wait association does not identify the awakened TID or prove causality; no stack, instruction pointer, or wchan was captured.
- GDB/ptrace feasibility is untested. A no-go stops the diagnostic; no alternate tracer is proposed.
- The accepted five-minute reproduction still fails AC-4. The 600-frame traces are diagnostic and do not replace acceptance.
- DQBUF counted 602 successful calls for 600 outputs without sequence fields, so exact dequeue-to-output frame identity remains unproven.
- AC-6 reconnect/sibling continuity and AC-8 four-camera soak remain hardware deferrals; the minor FFmpeg child resource-limit finding remains open.

